OL,3,GNEWSAGovernor says school uniform
OL,4,Apolicy 'outdated'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school governor has said her own
OL,7,Feducation trust's uniform policy is
OL,8,F"too prescriptive" and "outdated".
OL,10,FEleanor Baggaley, a school governor for
OL,11,FThorp Academy in Ryton, Gateshead, said
OL,12,Fparents were struggling with the cost
OL,13,Fof items with specific restrictions.
OL,15,FShe said some uniforms - like those
OL,16,Fadopted by the Northern Education Trust
OL,17,Fwhich runs the academy - were also
OL,18,Funsuitable for children with sensory
OL,19,Fissues, no longer relevant to the
OL,20,Fworking world and rooted in "victim
OL,21,Fblaming" culture towards girls.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
